From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 05:24:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: power: apple,pmc: describe the apple,pmp phandle

The T8132 PMC node names the PMP that initializes its voter interface
(apple,pmp = <&pmp> in t8132-memory.dtsi), but apple,pmc.yaml has no such
property, so dtbs_check reports "'apple,pmp' does not match any of the
regexes" for the PMC of every T8132 board (j604, j623, j624, j713, j715,
j773g). Describe the property as integration/aurora does.

[j604: partial backport: only the apple,pmp hunk of b811bfe35d. Its
 apple,t8132-pmc and apple,t8132-clpc compatibles are already in this file;
 its other 17 binding files are not part of this fix.]

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
(backported from commit b811bfe35dd8405a2c7112d9b3b3911b69be69c9)
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,pmc.yaml | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,pmc.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,pmc.yaml
index c7896d1320..ffa00e961e 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,pmc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,pmc.yaml
@@ -56,6 +56,10 @@ properties:
   '#size-cells':
     const: 0
 
+  apple,pmp:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle
+    description: PMP firmware owner that initializes the voter interface.
+
   apple,static-voters:
     $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32-array
     description: Voter agents to enable on every rail.
